flowchart TD
    Start([hexa gh label sync])

    Start --> CheckGitRepo{git repo?}
    CheckGitRepo -->|NO| ErrorExit1[Error: not a git repo]
    CheckGitRepo -->|YES| CheckGhAuth

    CheckGhAuth{gh authenticated?}
    CheckGhAuth -->|NO| ErrorExit2[Error: gh not authenticated]
    CheckGhAuth -->|YES| CheckRemote

    CheckRemote{gh remote exists?}
    CheckRemote -->|NO| ErrorExit3[Error: no remote]
    CheckRemote -->|YES| ReadConfig

    ReadConfig[ReadGithubLabelsFromConfig]
    ReadConfig --> ConfigCheck{.hexa.yml exists?}

    ConfigCheck -->|NO| ErrorExit4[❌ BUG: os.ReadFile error]
    ConfigCheck -->|YES| KeyCheck

    KeyCheck{github.labels exists?}
    KeyCheck -->|NO| ErrorExit5[❌ BUG: ReadYAMLField error]
    KeyCheck -->|YES| LabelsNil

    LabelsNil{labels != nil?}
    LabelsNil -->|YES| ConfirmSync[Confirm: Data exists, sync again?]
    LabelsNil -->|NO| ConfirmFetch[Confirm: No data, fetch from GH?]

    ConfirmSync --> UserConfirm1{user confirms?}
    ConfirmFetch --> UserConfirm2{user confirms?}

    UserConfirm1 -->|NO| Exit[Exit cleanly]
    UserConfirm2 -->|NO| Exit

    UserConfirm1 -->|YES| FetchLabels
    UserConfirm2 -->|YES| FetchLabels

    FetchLabels[gh label list --json]
    FetchLabels --> FetchOk{fetch success?}

    FetchOk -->|NO| ErrorExit6[Error: gh fetch failed]
    FetchOk -->|YES| GetConfigPath

    GetConfigPath[GetProjectConfigPath]
    GetConfigPath --> PathOk{path resolved?}

    PathOk -->|NO| ErrorExit7[Error: config path]
    PathOk -->|YES| UpdateYAML

    UpdateYAML[UpdateYAMLField]
    UpdateYAML --> UpdateOk{update success?}

    UpdateOk -->|NO| ErrorExit8[Error: YAML write failed]
    UpdateOk -->|YES| MarshalJSON

    MarshalJSON[json.Marshal]
    MarshalJSON --> MarshalOk{marshal ok?}

    MarshalOk -->|NO| ErrorExit9[Error: JSON marshal]
    MarshalOk -->|YES| JqPipe

    JqPipe[pipe to jq for pretty print]
    JqPipe --> JqExists{jq binary exists?}

    JqExists -->|NO| ErrorExit10[❌ BUG: jq not found, already mutated YAML]
    JqExists -->|YES| JqSuccess

    JqSuccess{jq success?}
    JqSuccess -->|NO| ErrorExit11[❌ BUG: jq failed, already mutated YAML]
    JqSuccess -->|YES| End

    End([Success])

    ErrorExit1 --> Stop([Exit 1])
    ErrorExit2 --> Stop
    ErrorExit3 --> Stop
    ErrorExit4 --> Stop
    ErrorExit5 --> Stop
    ErrorExit6 --> Stop
    ErrorExit7 --> Stop
    ErrorExit8 --> Stop
    ErrorExit9 --> Stop
    ErrorExit10 --> Stop
    ErrorExit11 --> Stop

    style ErrorExit4 fill:#ff6b6b
    style ErrorExit5 fill:#ff6b6b
    style ErrorExit10 fill:#ff6b6b
    style ErrorExit11 fill:#ff6b6b
    style ConfigCheck fill:#ffe66d
    style KeyCheck fill:#ffe66d
    style JqExists fill:#ffe66d
